    Priority	Item	Why
Critical	Payment Gateway (Razorpay/Stripe)	Currently only COD — no online payments
High	Order notifications — email/SMS to admin on new order	You won't know someone ordered unless you check admin
High	HTTPS/SSL + custom domain	Required for payments & trust
High	Privacy Policy & Terms pages	Legally required for selling
Medium	Contact page (phone/email/address)	Customer trust & support
Medium	Google Analytics / Facebook Pixel	Track ads & conversions
Medium	robots.txt + sitemap.xml	SEO for product pages
Low	Toast notifications instead of alert()	Better UX
Low	Loading skeletons for product lists	Polish